@base=http://localhost:4000/api
@json=Content-Type: application/json
### health via auth state
GET {{base}}/auth/me
### signup
POST {{base}}/auth/signup
{{json}}
{"full_name":"Demo User","email":"demo@example.com","phone":"9876500000","password":"DemoPass123","licence_no":"DL-DEMO-0001","licence_expiry":"2030-12-31","date_of_birth":"2000-01-01"}
### login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
{{json}}
{"email":"customer1@example.com","password":"Password@123"}
### list vehicles
GET {{base}}/vehicles?city=Chandigarh
### customer bookings (after login)
GET {{base}}/bookings/mine
### admin report (admin login first)
GET {{base}}/admin/reports/categories
